FerrionOS change to Zed (crates/livekit_client, crates/audio and crates/call, GPL-3.0-or-later, kept), made against release v1.29.3, commit d01b134cddf5e4f71964deb2d6f81cdb38fcf1e7:
- These crates take the stub path FreeBSD uses, so libwebrtc, a prebuilt download with no build for this target, is left out. Calls and screen sharing do not work.

